+The source-reviewed `../hayward_full_dd_geometry_export_controls_001` remains
+unexecuted. Its reader compared observation metadata with exported rows but
+missed direct native joins for event/origin associations and absolute channel
+epochs. This variant joins both event/origin sides (absent j remains blank)
+and every first-channel/epoch field on all rows. Eleven additional controls
+change both the original observation and its exported metadata together, so
+they cannot pass merely through mutual agreement. Pick/arrival strings remain
+preserved provenance; this reader does not invent external pick associations.
+`correction.patch` records the source-only correction before execution.
